<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Wed Mar 11 2020 12:18:31 GMT-0400 (EDT) tc</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jonah Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jon.</para>
  <para style="mt">Jonah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jonah Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Jonah au caihakecibe Tinggwang pecu sangme deu Nineveh namdi ga zierang teilo qu kelube. Jonah Tinggwang dade pakdi kera teicu nah pecu heka kedi ge ne mneu lu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Heka cide pecu kideu gage kaidi kebeudau, Jonah Nineveh ga mie eh minadung de Tinggwang tutiak mrai rangbeu. Jonah cilu, pe swagah tei eh, Tinggwang au pecu ci kemak namdi ga minadung helungnreu lucai penui mau de gibeu kerade.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Jonah RAMPAUBE dade pak kedi (1:1-17)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jonah kekie nah kelikebeu (2:1-10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jonah Nineveh ga kemie (3:1-10)</para>
  <para style="io1">Jonah RAMPAUBE ngaugia de pe rata kedi (4:1-11)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JON 1" />
  <para style="s">Jonah RAMPAUBE dade pak kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 1:1" />Tingnai ge RAMPAUBE Amittai napei Jonah dage sam ranggai, <verse eid="JON 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 1:2" />“Cuhlu, delwe namdi kedi Nineveh ga miecu, nah namdi cide de kemmau sam sah eh ranglo, kedanemene cika minadung daikenzwa gede siabi Ih cibam dida.” <verse eid="JON 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 1:3" />Dede Jonah RAMPAUBE dwa gade Tarshish namdi gage pak gaidi kera teilu. Nah pa Joppa namdi ga nghunglu ge liem ge Tarshish ga mielai bam eh ngaulu. Cine pa pe zie peudi eh Tarshish ga mie kera liemketeume de nzanglwe liem ga nghanglu, RAMPAUBE dade mdei tetdi kerane.<verse eid="JON 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 1:4" />Dede RAMPAUBE jaaidi reu gage tingkai cisüt kecu ge langgai, nah jaaidi ga rahang kedi ge gwangdi, iciu eh liem de siadi kera hingdi. <verse eid="JON 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 1:5" />Ge liemketeume de keheudi eh mi hangge ge kecu pe rabe rip dade kengha kie ciaudi. Pecai penui liem ga kebam maniadung de jaaidi gage kelien gaidi, penui liem tei ncalu kerane. Dede Jonah liem lungki ga nghung bam, nah gwang zeu zip zing de bam.<verse eid="JON 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 1:6" />Cidau liem teukela kedibe gwang eh Jonah dage rangdi, “Nang daitei eh zip bamno? Cuhlu! N tinggwang dade kengha kielu. Iciude tinggwang anuide ngaungngia eh anuide ngkapdi melu builu.”<verse eid="JON 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 1:7" />Cidau penui pelane penui zangme dade rangdi, “Ko, anui dacak piego, ciude anui caube ziemne makesia aide anuida gwang bamdi debi cilu kerane.” Cine penui dacak piege, ge Jonah reuga gwangdi. <verse eid="JON 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 1:8" />Pecai penui pecu keteudi, “Cau ziemne kesia aide anui da gwangbam bi kehereide anui dage ranglia lo. Nang dai ta tei lano nah nang dai gade gwang lano? Nang dai deudi gade no nah nang dai leuhme no?”<verse eid="JON 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 1:9" />Cine pa penui dage rangdi, “Ih au Hebrewme ge, kideu kecang nah jaaidi tei kegai RAMPAUBE tinggim Tinggwang de Ih reca la.”<verse eid="JON 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 1:10" />Liemketeume ngngi sütdi, nah penui pe dade, “Nang ai dai teidi deno?” de rangdi, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE dwa gade pak lalie kecu penui cilu, pa penuide ranglia kebeune. <verse eid="JON 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 1:11" />Herahang mtei reureu kedine penui pe dage rangdi, “Rahang de kaamdi kerane anui nda ge daipai teigai lubui no?”<verse eid="JON 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JON 1:12" />Nah pa penui dage rangdi, “Acu teucuh lwe jaaidi gage kelien gaidi lulo. Ciciude duikedi de nkam dizie, kedanemene rahang kedi nnui da gwang kebam aide a ziemne lie kecu Ih cibam.”<verse eid="JON 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JON 1:13" />Duikung ga mpet liem taugai lu kerane penui laikai tei, dede penui mpet luma, kedanemene rahang de sia reureu eh penui reu gwang kedine. <verse eid="JON 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JON 1:14" />Cine penui RAMPAUBE dage mragai, “O! RAMPAUBO, mina aipau de teilung ge ziemne anui teilung ngkapdi helo nah kemci jai anui reu gage kaidi helo. Kedanemene RAMPAUBO, nang n lungning teicang kelune.” <verse eid="JON 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JON 1:15" />Cine penui Jonah de jaaidi gage pwa kelien gaidi, ge rahang nkam zing dedi. <verse eid="JON 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JON 1:16" />Cidau liemketeume RAMPAUBE de hing sütdi, nah penui RAMPAUBE dage ratak ge teigai beu, nah pegwa tei kera sampetlu.<verse eid="JON 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JON 1:17" />RAMPAUBE Jonah de mneu kera heka kedi ge langgai, nah Jonah heka pok ga tingmui tingba langcumne ladi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kesa Kesanglaisiu ga aipau sam de perwak 2 pedum 1 raitu gage rau pwa bam.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:40">Mat. 12:40</ref></char></note><verse eid="JON 1:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JON 2" />
  <para style="s">Jonah kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 2:1" />Jonah heka pok gade RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang dage kiegai, <verse eid="JON 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 2:2" />pa rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:2">“A lungrei gade, Ih RAMPAUBE da mragai, nah pa acu kelibeu da;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:2">ketsaime deu kecok gade Ih mragai, nah nang a kwa siu luda.<verse eid="JON 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 2:3" />Nang acu jaaidi kecok sum gage kelien gai, nah duicui ne acu twagwapung bam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:3">n kengkieng dui nswakdung a reu mlaibam.<verse eid="JON 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 2:4" />Ge Ih ranggai, ‘Acu n dwa gade gwa dida;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:4">dede Ih n kemci kerecaki de nreu piedai zie.’<verse eid="JON 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 2:5" />Dui a reu gwa gwang acu cimlu, duikedi ne acu twagwa pung;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:5">jaaidihei a peu kezuilu.<verse eid="JON 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 2:6" />Ih lamlwatu mahdung ga nghung da, kideu ga kebam riedung le acu kelungta twagwalu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:6">dede RAMPAUBE a Tinggwang, nang hekwaki kecok gade acu ngngwa nghangdai beu da.<verse eid="JON 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 2:7" />A rabe nnei kedi dau, Ih RAMPAUBE de nsunglu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:7">nah a kekie, n kemci kerecaki ga nda gwanglu.<verse eid="JON 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 2:8" />Kemta mamiedung reca kelamedung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:8">penui samkakkelu kesamsang de gi dida.<verse eid="JON 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 2:9" />Dede Ih au ncu ketwa le pwa ratak tei beuzie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JON 2:9">Ih sampet kelude teicang zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JON 2:9">Kelikelu au RAMPAUBE dade gwangla!”<verse eid="JON 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 2:10" />Pecai RAMPAUBE heka de aja kaigai, ge heka Jonah de hangdeu kecang gage mlwak mpet gaibeu.<verse eid="JON 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JON 3" />
  <para style="s">Jonah Nineveh ga kemie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 3:1" />Pecai RAMPAUBE sam Jonah da pe kenabe gwang eh ranggai, <verse eid="JON 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 3:2" />“Cuhlu delwe namdi kedi Nineveh ga miecu, nah Ih n dage rang kebeude minadung dage rang ndu gaibeu lulo.” <verse eid="JON 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 3:3" />Cine Jonah cuhlwe RAMPAUBE sam mzai eh Nineveh ga miedi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JON 3:3">Nineveh au namdi kedi ge, cide tetkah gwang kera lang cumne keula.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Lang cumne </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kilometer riakhekui.</char></note><verse eid="JON 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 3:4" />Cine Jonah Nineveh namdi ga mie kera tetcuh gai, cide langnai ge beuh dei ge.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Langnai ge beu dei ge </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilometer camrei.</char></note> Nah pa sah eh rangdi, “Zie riakdai gage Nineveh de ngkap dizie.”<verse eid="JON 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 3:5" />Ninevehme Tinggwang sam nlumlu. Penui pelane rosopai bahlwe mmwang kera tiaklu, kedi gade keceu kecang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:41">Mat. 12:41</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JON 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 3:6" />Nineveh gwangpei aipau samde siu luge, pa pe hegwangbam gade cuhlwe pa teukela paini lwakdi, nah pa rosopai bahlu delwe pe mau pet eh mimüt ga ntum bamdi.<verse eid="JON 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 3:7" />Nah pa Nineveh ga lunghkebam pelane dage hegwangpei nah pe kangga kedime dade aja ge kaigai, “Mina mede makaune, ketum mede meurün, magede teilak; makaune matyei mede sak lak. <verse eid="JON 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 3:8" />Dede mina nah makaune leune de rosopai bahlu maisia; nah penui kengkieng teu Tinggwang dage mragai maisia; delwe keheibe de pe kesia lampui gade nreulu maisia nah pe kenlien zaidung de gidi maisia. <verse eid="JON 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 3:9" />Cau ne rang cilai? Tinggwang helung nreulwe anuide ngaungia eh pe rata kebam gade nlidi lubui nah anui tsaidi lak!”<verse eid="JON 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 3:10" />Tinggwang penui tei kegai de nah penui kenlien zaidung gade nreu kelu ngau luge, pa penuide saja peu zielie kebam de gade pe lung nreudi; nah pa cide tei tadi.<verse eid="JON 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="JON 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JON 4" />
  <para style="s">Jonah RAMPAUBE ngaugia de pe rata kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JON 4:1" />Jonah aide pesui mezingdi, nah pa pe ratadi. <verse eid="JON 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JON 4:2" />Cine pa RAMPAUBE dage kie eh rangdi, “O RAMPAUBO, Ih a deudi ga kebam dau aide a sam meni? Aide ziemne Ih Tarshish gage pakgai kera a laikai tei, kedanemene nang au ngaugia nah keku Tinggwang kecu Ih ci, nlung tiesüt nah samsang muila, nah nang au kesia ketei gade nlung nreu dila. <verse eid="JON 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JON 4:3" />Cine cu, RAMPAUBO, Ih n dade a ngia kiela, acu peu tsai dilu. Kedanemene Ih ringkebam swa tsai kedibe yiki dida.”<verse eid="JON 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JON 4:4" />Nah RAMPAUBE Jonah de keligai, “Nang aide ziemne n rata kera petau ni?”<verse eid="JON 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JON 4:5" />Cipau cai Jonah namdi gwale mpetlwe naimiak kepetle de namdi kengau ga ntumlu. Nah pa cika pe ziemne kensiu bam ge teilwe pa cipau sung kangga ntumlu, namdi de dainzwa dizie bi kecu kwa eh pie kera.<verse eid="JON 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JON 4:6" />Cidau RAMPAUBE Tinggwang tsingbang ge de peu lungh cuhlu, Jonah de sunglu kerane nah peu pecu reluilu kerane. Nah Jonah tsingbang de ngau pesui sütlu. <verse eid="JON 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JON 4:7" />Dede pecai benai tingcang nuge Tinggwang peu tangseu ge de tsingbang de tei msiadi kera kaigai; nah cide tsingbang de tyeidi, ge reguidi. <verse eid="JON 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JON 4:8" />Nah naimiak pet herizi, Tinggwang naimiak kepetle tingkai kelum ge langgai; ge Jonah peu pusütdi eh pa kaudi kera nzwadi. Cidau pa pe rabe de tsaidi lo eh kie eh rangdi, “Ih ringkebam swa tsai kedibe yiki dida.”<verse eid="JON 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JON 4:9" />Cidau Tinggwang Jonah de keteugai, “Nang tsingbang de ziemne nrata kera petau ni?” Nah Jonah rangdi, “Ih a rata kera petau lie, tsailu kera kecang de.”<verse eid="JON 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JON 4:10" />Ge RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Nang au, nang magede teigai kemak mede nang tei mlunggai kemak tingbang de ziemne n lung siala; tsingbang cide zeuziu ge gage lungh cuhlu nah cide zeuziu ge gage tsaidi. <verse eid="JON 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JON 4:11" />Cine Ih, namdi kedi Nineveh, cika minadung 120,000 swade kiee bam, minadung penui ba zetle nah hile ci ntsamlu kemakmedung, nah makaune kekiee de si eh kebam ziemne a lung sialak ni?”<verse eid="JON 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JON 4" />
</usx>